  SYNC        web        volume   site                       
  SYNC        prober     volume   data                       writable
  SYNC        prober     build    app                        
  SYNC        app_conf   config   configs/app.conf           
  EMPTY    ghost      volume   not-here                   not on this machine — nothing to mount
  NEW      db         volume   pgdata                     not here yet — the container creates it · writable
  SERVER   web        volume   /etc/localtime             the server's own copy is used
  MISSING  worker     volume   /opt/certs                 NOT on the server
